            "text": "the advertisement support question, which is asked immediately after being presented with the advertisement itself.",
            "page": 5
          },
          {
            "text": "Lastly, a manipulation check was included after exposure to the\nnarrative, specifically asking participants to state the extent to which they agreed with the statement, “I had an emotional\nreaction to this narrative.”",
