            "page": 9
          },
          {
            "text": "There were no statistically significant differences\nbetween either the Control and Trump Ad Alone groups, nor the Trump Ad Alone and Counter-Narrative First group.",
            "page": 9
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "claim": "Supplemental analyses examined individual attitude items, sociodemographic predictors, and differences in treatment effects by whether respondents identified as justice-system impacted.",
        "quotes": [
          {
            "text": "treatment effects",
